Copyright (C) 2020-2026 Denver Technologies, Inc.

Warpeer is based on Warp upstream commit 17f4ec80ffa80749be035b2c2405e0f180a60e2e.
The modifications turn Warp into a terminal-only product: account, cloud, hosted AI,
telemetry, and auto-update features are removed or disabled, and Warpeer-specific
terminal, pane, theme, and privacy features are added.

This fork additionally integrates Warp upstream through commit
0f81fad401df526e440083f95efa287a2e02f5b3 (2026-11-17), adds local Markdown
runbooks, and builds Windows x86-64, Linux x86-64, and macOS ARM64 packages.

